              "description": "OPEN vocabulary — how the build OBTAINS this dependency. Recommended values: system (find_package/expected pre-installed), vendored (source copied into the tree), fetchcontent (CMake FetchContent), download_build (ExternalProject/custom download-source-and-build), submodule (git submodule), package_manager (vcpkg/conan/pip/npm/maven), prebuilt_binary (binary shipped in repo). If none fits, coin a concise lowercase token (e.g. conda, apt, cpm, git_subtree, runtime_download) AND record it in meta.observations. Also set the closed `locality` field accordingly."},
            "locality": {"type": "string",
              "enum": ["local", "remote", "system", "runtime", "unknown"],
